{"unit_id":"rain02333z-spec__dsh-plugin-sidebar-manager#feature-1","repo":"rain02333z-spec/dsh-plugin-sidebar-manager","commit":"061b84265b91f7c24db8f8a6a3a15129db4226aa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**DSH Sidebar Plugin Manager** 的功能「插件列表与分类」：面板读取 Host 提供的插件清单，并将系统模块和用户新增模块分组展示，同时显示插件总数。 通过侧栏插件面板触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/PluginManagerPanel.tsx:113-166"]}
